{"id":410,"date":"2022-04-22T12:11:40","date_gmt":"2022-04-22T12:11:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/?page_id=410"},"modified":"2024-07-26T10:17:00","modified_gmt":"2024-07-26T10:17:00","slug":"federal-labz","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/federal-labz\/","title":{"rendered":"Federal Labz &#8211; Incubation Centre"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Federal Labz \u2013 Incubation Centre<\/strong><\/p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">FISAT has set up a fully fledged facility called federal labz for incubating start-ups inside the campus. It is a fully air-conditioned space with all modern amenities required for the functioning of a start-up company. The centre plays a catalytic role in promoting indigenous technology development and carrying out research activities at low cost. The potential technology aspirers and entrepreneurs with innovative ideas are nurtured through different phases of growth until their research takes off to a maturity level where it becomes a viable venture. \u00a0The cutting edge facilities provided in the Institute, and the expertise offered by faculty who are experienced in their specialised areas, help the aspirants to implement their idea.<\/p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Recently, the incubation centre is upgraded to the status of Technology Business Incubator (TBI) with the support of Kerala start-up Mission (KSUM).<\/p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1853\" src=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1496925411_incubation-centre-2-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"503\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1496925411_incubation-centre-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1496925411_incubation-centre-2-300x2